-obligation-atlas-交付说明","rel":"2-Areas/2.3 Legal AI/Agent Skills/aml-obligation-atlas-交付说明.md","href":"../2-Areas/2.3%20Legal%20AI/Agent%20Skills/aml-obligation-atlas-%E4%BA%A4%E4%BB%98%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%8E","openTasks":0,"tags":[],"mtime":"3 天前"},{"title":"Prompt-新业务AML合规论证","rel":"2-Areas/2.3 Legal AI/Prompt-新业务AML合规论证.md","href":"../2-Areas/2.3%20Legal%20AI/Prompt-%E6%96%B0%E4%B8%9A%E5%8A%A1AML%E5%90%88%E8%A7%84%E8%AE%BA%E8%AF%81","openTasks":0,"tags":[],"mtime":"3 天前"},{"title":"Legal English Vault","rel":"2-Areas/2.5 Cross-Border Legal Work/Legal English Vault.md","href":"../2-Areas/2.5%20Cross-Border%20Legal%20Work/Legal%20English%20Vault","openTasks":0,"tags":[],"mtime":"10 天前"}]},{"folder":"3-Resources","items":[{"title":"_index","rel":"3-Resources/算力供应商Crusoe-KYC/_index.md","href":"../3-Resources/%E7%AE%97%E5%8A%9B%E4%BE%9B%E5%BA%94%E5%95%86Crusoe-KYC/_index","openTasks":0,"tags":["sanction/kyc"],"mtime":"今天"},{"title":"Temu-使用条款-EU","rel":"3-Resources/Temu-使用条款-EU.md","href":"../3-Resources/Temu-%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%9D%A1%E6%AC%BE-EU","openTasks":0,"tags":["cross-border","terms"],"mtime":"今天"},{"title":"202611-算力供应商Crusoe-KYC答复策略","rel":"3-Resources/算力供应商Crusoe-KYC/Cases/202611-算力供应商Crusoe-KYC答复策略.md","href":"../3-Resources/%E7%AE%97%E5%8A%9B%E4%BE%9B%E5%BA%94%E5%95%86Crusoe-KYC/Cases/202611-%E7%AE%97%E5%8A%9B%E4%BE%9B%E5%BA%94%E5%95%86Crusoe-KYC%E7%AD%94%E5%A4%8D%E7%AD%96%E7%95%A5","openTasks":0,"tags":["sanction/cases","算力"],"mtime":"今天"},{"title":"Crusoe-KYC问卷","rel":"3-Resources/算力供应商Crusoe-KYC/sources/Crusoe-KYC问卷.md","href":"../3-Resources/%E7%AE%97%E5%8A%9B%E4%BE%9B%E5%BA%94%E5%95%86Crusoe-KYC/sources/Crusoe-KYC%E9%97%AE%E5%8D%B7","openTasks":0,"tags":["sanction/kyc","算力"],"mtime":"今天"},{"title":"20261110-法务合规周会-发言准备","rel":"3-Resources/Meetings/20261110-法务合规周会-发言准备.md","href":"../3-Resources/Meetings/20261110-%E6%B3%95%E5%8A%A1%E5%90%88%E8%A7%84%E5%91%A8%E4%BC%9A-%E5%8F%91%E8%A8%80%E5%87%86%E5%A4%87","openTasks":0,"tags":[],"mtime":"今天"},{"title":"LogosCowork-知识管理专家配置体验","rel":"3-Resources/LogosCowork-知识管理专家配置体验.md","href":"../3-Resources/LogosCowork-%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E4%B8%93%E5%AE%B6%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E4%BD%93%E9%AA%8C","openTasks":0,"tags":[],"mtime":"3 天前"},{"title":"未来想要独立负责的反洗钱工作清单","rel":"3-Resources/未来想要独立负责的反洗钱工作清单.md","href":"../3-Resources/%E6%9C%AA%E6%9D%A5%E6%83%B3%E8%A6%81%E7%8B%AC%E7%AB%8B%E8%B4%9F%E8%B4%A3%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%8D%E6%B4%97%E9%92%B1%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E6%B8%85%E5%8D%95","openTasks":0,"tags":[],"mtime":"7 天前"}]}],"tags":[{"name":"贵金属","count":4},{"name":"aml/projects","count":3},{"name":"clippings","count":3},{"name":"legal-ai/prompt","count":2},{"name":"复盘/周","count":2},{"name":"cross-border","count":2},{"name":"算力","count":2},{"name":"sanction/kyc","count":2},{"name":"AI","count":1},{"name":"aml/regulations","count":1},{"name":"aml/concepts","count":1},{"name":"支付","count":1},{"name":"aml/sop","count":1},{"name":"风控","count":1},{"name":"aml","count":1},{"name":"sanction","count":1},{"name":"复盘","count":1},{"name":"legal-ai","count":1},{"name":"periodic/weekly","count":1},{"name":"cross-border/concepts","count":1},{"name":"商家协议","count":1},{"name":"terms","count":1},{"name":"sanction/cases","count":1},{"name":"system/log","count":1},{"name":"复盘/月","count":1},{"name":"system/spec","count":1},{"name":"system/home","count":1},{"name":"system/dashboard","count":1}],"health":[{"file":"1-Projects/欧盟BBC贵金属反洗钱管控/deliverables/20261109-欧盟BBC银饰买断转售-AML评估报告-v1.md","issue":"项目笔记缺 状态: 字段（进行中 / 暂停 / 已完成）"},{"file":"1-Projects/英国本本二手收藏品AML评估/ECSH54525 - Introduction to art market participants - HMRC internal manual.md","issue":"项目笔记缺 状态: 字段（进行中 / 暂停 / 已完成）"},{"file":"1-Projects/英国本本二手收藏品AML评估/_index.md","issue":"项目笔记缺 状态: 字段（进行中 / 暂停 / 已完成）"},{"file":"1-Projects/英国本本二手收藏品AML评估/英国本本-收藏品画作-反洗钱合规评估报告.md","issue":"项目笔记缺 状态: 字段（进行中 / 暂停 / 已完成）"}],"stats":{"todayCount":2,"openTasks":14,"projectCount":7,"noteCount":50}}</script>
<script>
(function(){
  var DATA = JSON.parse(document.getElementById('payload').textContent);
  var esc = function(s){ return String(s==null?'':s).replace(/[&<>"']/g,function(c){
    return {'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c]; }); };
  var WEEK = ['周日','周一','周二','周三','周四','周五','周六'];

  document.getElementById('today-label').textContent = DATA.generatedAtLabel;

  // ---- chips
  var overdue = DATA.today.filter(function(t){ return t.overdueDays > 0; }).length;
  var chips = [
    {t:'今日到期', v:DATA.stats.todayCount},
    {t:'已逾期', v:overdue, warn:overdue>0},
    {t:'未完成待办', v:DATA.stats.openTasks},
    {t:'项目', v:DATA.stats.projectCount},
    {t:'笔记', v:DATA.stats.noteCount}
  ];
  document.getElementById('chips').innerHTML = chips.map(function(c){
    return '<span class="chip'+(c.warn?' warn':'')+'">'+esc(c.t)+' <b>'+c.v+'</b></span>';
  }).join('');

  // ---- task item renderer
  function taskLi(t){
    var dueBadge = '';
    if (t.due){
      if (t.overdueDays > 0) dueBadge = '<span class="badge over">逾期 '+t.overdueDays+' 天 · '+esc(t.due)+'</span>';
      else if (t.overdueDays === 0) dueBadge = '<span class="badge due">今天 · '+esc(t.due)+'</span>';
      else dueBadge = '<span class="badge">'+esc(t.due)+'</span>';
    }
    if (t.legacy) dueBadge += ' <span class="badge">日期写法待统一</span>';
    var src = t.sourceTitle ? '<span class="badge src">'+esc(t.sourceTitle)+'</span>' : '';
    return '<li>'
      + '<span class="box'+(t.overdueDays>0?' over':'')+'"></span>'
      + '<span class="t-main"><span class="t-text">'+esc(t.text)+'</span>'
      + '<span class="t-meta">'+dueBadge+src+'</span></span>'
      + '</li>';
  }

  // ---- 1 today
  var todayBox = document.getElementById('today-list');
  document.getElementById('today-count').textContent = DATA.today.length ? DATA.today.length+' 项' : '';
  todayBox.innerHTML = DATA.today.length
    ? '<ul class="list">'+DATA.today.map(taskLi).join('')+'</ul>'
    : '<div class="empty">今天没有到期任务。享受一下，或者去把收件箱清一清。</div>';

  // ---- 2 projects
  var pg = document.getElementById('proj-grid');
  document.getElementById('proj-count').textContent = DATA.projects.length ? DATA.projects.length+' 个' : '';
  if (!DATA.projects.length){
    pg.innerHTML = '<div class="card"><div class="empty">1-Projects 里还没有带任务的笔记。</div></div>';
  } else {
    pg.innerHTML = DATA.projects.map(function(p){
      var st = p.status || '未标注';
      var cls = /进行|active|doing/i.test(st) ? 'run' : (/完成|done|closed/i.test(st) ? 'done' : (/暂停|pause|hold/i.test(st) ? 'pause' : ''));
      var pct = p.progress == null ? null : Math.round(p.progress*100);
      var bar = pct == null ? '' : '<div class="bar"><span style="width:'+pct+'%"></span></div>';
      var foot = pct == null
        ? '<div class="p-foot"><span>暂无任务</span><span>'+esc(p.mtime)+'</span></div>'
        : '<div class="p-foot"><span>'+p.doneTasks+'/'+p.totalTasks+' · '+pct+'%</span><span>'+esc(p.mtime)+'</span></div>';
      return '<div class="proj">'
        + '<div class="p-top"><a class="p-name" href="'+esc(p.href)+'">'+esc(p.name)+'</a>'
        + '<span class="status '+cls+'">'+esc(st)+'</span></div>'
        + bar + foot + '</div>';
    }).join('');
  }

  // ---- 3 inbox
  var ib = document.getElementById('inbox-list');
  document.getElementById('inbox-count').textContent = DATA.inbox.length ? DATA.inbox.length+' 条' : '';
  ib.innerHTML = DATA.inbox.length
    ? '<ul class="list">'+DATA.inbox.map(function(n){
        return '<li><span class="t-main"><a class="t-text" href="'+esc(n.href)+'">'+esc(n.title)+'</a>'
          + '<span class="t-meta"><span class="badge">'+esc(n.rel)+'</span>'
          + (n.openTasks ? '<span class="badge due">'+n.openTasks+' 项待办</span>' : '')
          + '<span class="badge">'+esc(n.mtime)+'</span></span></span></li>';
      }).join('')+'</ul>'
    : '<div class="empty">收件箱是空的。</div>';

  // ---- 4 nav + search + tags
  var navBody = document.getElementById('nav-body');
  var activeTag = null;
  function renderNav(){
    var q = (document.getElementById('q').value || '').trim().toLowerCase();
    var html = '';
    var shown = 0;
    DATA.nav.forEach(function(g){
      var items = g.items.filter(function(n){
        if (activeTag && (n.tags||[]).indexOf(activeTag) < 0) return false;
        if (!q) return true;
        return (n.title+' '+n.rel+' '+(n.tags||[]).join(' ')).toLowerCase().indexOf(q) >= 0;
      });
      if (!items.length) return;
      shown += items.length;
      html += '<div class="folder"><h3>'+esc(g.folder)+' · '+items.length+'</h3><ul>'
        + items.map(function(n){
            return '<li><a href="'+esc(n.href)+'">'+esc(n.title)+'</a>'
              + (n.openTasks ? '<span class="mini">'+n.openTasks+' 待办</span>' : '')
              + '</li>';
          }).join('')
        + '</ul></div>';
    });
    if (!shown) html = '<div class="empty">没有匹配的笔记。</div>';
    var tags = DATA.tags.slice(0, 14).map(function(t){
      return '<button class="tag'+(activeTag===t.name?'':' off')+'" data-tag="'+esc(t.name)+'">'
        + esc(t.name)+' '+(t.count||'')+'</button>';
    }).join('');
    html += '<div class="tags" style="margin-top:14px">'+tags+'</div>';
    navBody.innerHTML = html;
    Array.prototype.forEach.call(navBody.querySelectorAll('.tag'), function(b){
      b.onclick = function(){
        var v = b.getAttribute('data-tag');
        activeTag = (activeTag === v) ? null : v;
        renderNav();
      };
    });
  }
  document.getElementById('q').addEventListener('input', renderNav);
  document.getElementById('nav-count').textContent = DATA.stats.noteCount+' 篇';
  renderNav();

  // ---- 5 rest tasks grouped
  var allBox = document.getElementById('all-list');
  var groups = DATA.restGroups;
  document.getElementById('all-count').textContent = groups.reduce(function(a,g){return a+g.tasks.length;},0)+' 项';
  allBox.innerHTML = groups.length
    ? groups.map(function(g,i){
        return '<details class="group"'+(i===0?' open':'')+'><summary>'
          + '<span class="g-name">'+esc(g.title)+'</span>'
          + '<span class="g-count">'+g.tasks.length+' 项</span></summary>'
          + '<ul class="list">'+g.tasks.map(taskLi).join('')+'</ul></details>';
      }).join('')
    : '<div class="empty">没有其他未完成待办。</div>';

  // ---- health
  if (DATA.health && DATA.health.length){
    document.getElementById('sec-health').style.display = '';
    document.getElementById('health-body').innerHTML = DATA.health.map(function(h){
      return '<div>· <b>'+esc(h.file)+'</b> — '+esc(h.issue)+'</div>';
    }).join('');
  }

  document.getElementById('gen-at').textContent = '生成时间 ' + DATA.generatedAt;
})();
</script>
</body>
</html>
